 "insight": [
  "In 2005, Luxembourg's top 10 export chapters accounted for most of its total exports of 15.39 billion euros.",
  "The largest export category was Machinery and mechanical appliances, making up 26.8% of exports, followed by Electrical machinery and equipment at 21.0%, and Iron and steel at 11.2%.",
  "Together, the top three export chapters represented 59.0% of total exports, showing a strong concentration in these sectors.",
  "Other categories like Plastics and articles thereof and Vehicles and parts contributed smaller shares of 4.7% and 3.9% respectively.",
  "The data are nominal values in current euros and include 0.4% confidential exports, which are not detailed but included in the totals."
 ],
